# Keyboard menus and window keys (0.13), on the Desktop (DESK=1). No mouse: the pointer
# stays where it starts. Raw keys: E2 left Alt, E0 left ctrl, 43 F10, 2B Tab, 3D F4, 1A W, 13 P,
# 12 O.
# (Files, opened by DESK at start, sets its menus while it starts: that closes an open menu, so wait)
# F10: the bar's first menu (Horizon) opens, its first item highlighted; Right: Programs
9000 {d43}{u43}
+500 {right}
+500 {down}
# shot 1 at 10.5 s: Programs open by the keyboard, its second item highlighted
+1000 {left}
+500 \n
# Left: back to Horizon (first item); Enter: About Horizon. shot 2 at 13.0 s: About
+2000 {dE0}{d1A}{u1A}{uE0}
# ctrl+W closes About (the focused window). shot 3 at 14.5 s: About gone
+1500 {dE2}{d13}{u13}{uE2}
# Alt+P: Programs open, Edit highlighted. shot 4 at 15.5 s
+1000 \n
# Enter: Edit starts. shot 5 at 18.0 s: Edit on top
+2500 {dE2}{d13}{u13}{uE2}
+500 t\n
# Alt+P, t (the next item starting with T: Terminal), Enter: the Terminal
+3000 wdemo menu\n
# shot 6 at 24.7 s: Alt+O in wdemo's window: Options with a check mark (Grid), a
# separator, a dimmed item (Print) and shortcuts
+2000 {dE2}{d12}{u12}{uE2}
+1000 {down}{down}
# Down, Down: Snap, then Quit (the separator and the dimmed Print skipped). shot 7 at 25.5 s
+800 {home}\n
# Home, Enter: Grid unchecked; Alt+W, Enter: Print enabled; Alt+O again. shot 8 at 27.9 s
+500 {dE2}{d1A}{u1A}{uE2}
+500 \n
+500 {dE2}{d12}{u12}{uE2}
+1000 {esc}
# Esc closes it. Alt alone: the first menu (Horizon) opens. shot 9 at 29.1 s
+500 {dE2}{uE2}
+600 {esc}
# Esc. Alt+Tab twice: the bottom-most normal window comes up each time
+500 {dE2}{d2B}{u2B}{uE2}
# shot 10 at 30.5 s
+1000 {dE2}{d2B}{u2B}{uE2}
# shot 11 at 31.5 s
+1000 {dE2}{d3D}{u3D}{uE2}
# Alt+F4 closes the focused window. shot 12 at 32.5 s
